### JSDoc Comments (20+ functions)
Every function/component now has a multi-line JSDoc comment listing:
- Function name and a separator line
- What it does in 1–3 bullet points
- Which use case(s) it covers

Example:
```tsx
/**
 * StudyGroupsPage  (UC 10, 11, 12, 13, 14)
 * ---------------
 * Three-tab view:
 *   • My Groups  — view joined groups, open group detail.    (UC 12, 13, 14)
 *   • Discover   — browse/join public groups.                (UC 11)
 *   • Create     — form to create a new study group.         (UC 10)
 */
```

### Blank Line Formatting
Added blank lines between:
- Import groups
- CSS animation blocks in GlobalStyles
- Design token declarations
- Interface definitions
- Mock data groups (Users → Study Groups → Resources → Messages → etc.)
- Component definitions

### Mock Data Sub-Headers
Each data group now has a `/* ───── Mock Data — [Topic] ───── */` divider and a `/** summary */` on the variable.

